{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 13448558276265113372,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Oyster PMOD",
      "source_hash": 1442433102171446131,
      "context_hash": 9349382145865971045,
      "translation": "Oyster PMOD",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:42.465110Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "![](Images/OysterPMOD.jpg)",
      "source_hash": 6263940603018394880,
      "context_hash": 5084508508828876951,
      "translation": "![](Images/OysterPMOD.jpg)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:42.465111Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Create your own OysterPMOD, with a 8x8 led matrix, and a 128x128 OLED display !",
      "source_hash": 13349293148297264600,
      "context_hash": 2446442116590324787,
      "translation": "8x8 LED 매트릭스와 128x128 OLED 디스플레이로 나만의 OysterPMOD를 만들어 봅시다!",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:42.465111Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "It can be assembled without any soldering.",
      "source_hash": 16279191956814833752,
      "context_hash": 6872477782582765365,
      "translation": "납땜 없이도 조립할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:42.465112Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:2",
      "source": "It is compatible with all femtorv processors and supported boards, and uses a single PMOD connector.",
      "source_hash": 5724342054875765536,
      "context_hash": 7989266184455704521,
      "translation": "모든 FemtoRV 프로세서 및 지원 보드와 호환되며, 하나의 PMOD 커넥터를 사용합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "FemtoRV": "FemtoRV"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:42.465112Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "You will need:",
      "source_hash": 13419054955926383212,
      "context_hash": 8401537560856938309,
      "translation": "필요한 것은 다음과 같습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:42.465113Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "an old plastic card (Oyster card, credit card ...)",
      "source_hash": 9092129891747015343,
      "context_hash": 3577756818400559801,
      "translation": "오래된 플라스틱 카드(Oyster 카드, 신용카드 등)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:42.465113Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "a MAX7219 driven 8x8 led matrix (costs around $2)",
      "source_hash": 18217874314986777967,
      "context_hash": 1092772131928355495,
      "translation": "MAX7219로 구동되는 8x8 LED 매트릭스(가격은 약 $2)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:42.465113Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "a SSD1351 128x128 oled display (costs around $10 - $15).",
      "source_hash": 12331326076223485834,
      "context_hash": 15792235826823284875,
      "translation": "SSD1351 128x128 OLED 디스플레이(가격은 약 $10 - $15).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:42.465113Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:6/seg:1",
      "source": "You may find cheaper clones, but they are sometimes reported not working.",
      "source_hash": 5543080365714011984,
      "context_hash": 2333223911061659810,
      "translation": "더 저렴한 복제품을 찾을 수도 있지만, 때로는 작동하지 않는다는 보고가 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:42.465113Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "female-female dupont connecting wires for the led matrix",
      "source_hash": 12183293477596367771,
      "context_hash": 8312127220472974652,
      "translation": "LED 매트릭스용 암-암 듀폰 연결 전선",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:42.465113Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "connecting wires for the OLED display (most of the time they are shipped with it)",
      "source_hash": 10153601509330969821,
      "context_hash": 9497338339847901964,
      "translation": "OLED 디스플레이용 연결 전선(대개 제품과 함께 제공됩니다)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:42.465114Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "small screws",
      "source_hash": 3285050721514117914,
      "context_hash": 13572509948935364174,
      "translation": "작은 나사",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:42.465114Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "a 2x6 pins header (or two 1x6 headers)",
      "source_hash": 2898012927226506101,
      "context_hash": 12930228217987208143,
      "translation": "2x6핀 헤더(또는 1x6 헤더 두 개)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:42.465114Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Step 1",
      "source_hash": 11215635334453140161,
      "context_hash": 7023084557409084125,
      "translation": "1단계",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:42.465114Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "drill holes in the plastic card",
      "source_hash": 7556308801185803767,
      "context_hash": 7233792448838128912,
      "translation": "플라스틱 카드에 구멍을 뚫습니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:42.465114Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "attach the led matrix and the OLED display to the plastic card",
      "source_hash": 3941923015171524365,
      "context_hash": 14022751415648917820,
      "translation": "LED 매트릭스와 OLED 디스플레이를 플라스틱 카드에 부착합니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:42.465114Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Step 2",
      "source_hash": 1818160219744617941,
      "context_hash": 15631988458791749979,
      "translation": "2단계",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:42.465115Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "![](Images/OysterPMOD_4.jpg) Insert the 2x6 pins header in the PMOD.",
      "source_hash": 13465478266343950269,
      "context_hash": 2954132117411254934,
      "translation": "![](Images/OysterPMOD_4.jpg) 2x6핀 헤더를 PMOD에 삽입합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:42.465115Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "The image shows what it looks like on the IceBreaker (left) and IceStick (right).",
      "source_hash": 2952967647750774193,
      "context_hash": 1225596605468076205,
      "translation": "이미지는 IceBreaker(왼쪽)와 IceStick(오른쪽)에서의 모습을 보여줍니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:42.465115Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "On the IceStick, I like to stick a tiny rectangle of red adhesive tape to indicate where the number 1 pin is.",
      "source_hash": 2308890258991516447,
      "context_hash": 7778305941510172848,
      "translation": "IceStick에서는 1번 핀 위치를 표시하기 위해 작은 빨간색 접착테이프 조각을 붙이는 것을 선호합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:42.465115Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Step 3",
      "source_hash": 7891936878072350928,
      "context_hash": 10638560073478519217,
      "translation": "3단계",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:42.465115Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "![](Images/OysterPMOD_1.jpg) Connect the wires of OLED screen to the headers as indicated on the diagram.",
      "source_hash": 13794158621613967232,
      "context_hash": 1765667824687282245,
      "translation": "![](Images/OysterPMOD_1.jpg) 다이어그램에 표시된 대로 OLED 화면의 전선을 헤더에 연결합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:42.465115Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Use 5 female-female dupont wires to connect the led matrix.",
      "source_hash": 2044246825351261296,
      "context_hash": 10017926759575470721,
      "translation": "LED 매트릭스를 연결하려면 암-암 듀폰 전선 5개를 사용합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:42.465116Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "Wonderful !",
      "source_hash": 6351233228373226735,
      "context_hash": 16577646135922334270,
      "translation": "훌륭합니다!",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:42.465116Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:3",
      "source": "Both exactly fit in a single PMOD connector.",
      "source_hash": 11990849932597165805,
      "context_hash": 16252807642953744489,
      "translation": "둘 다 하나의 PMOD 커넥터에 정확히 맞습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:42.465116Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Step 4",
      "source_hash": 3706853373433379257,
      "context_hash": 6279332754385414912,
      "translation": "4단계",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:42.465116Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "![](Images/OysterPMOD_3.jpg) Use adhesive tape to fix the 12 wires together.",
      "source_hash": 4127760544493608582,
      "context_hash": 13530740193702490763,
      "translation": "![](Images/OysterPMOD_3.jpg) 접착테이프를 사용하여 12개의 전선을 함께 고정합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:42.465116Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Add a tiny rectangle of red tape to indicate number 1 pin.",
      "source_hash": 13655334505021396549,
      "context_hash": 192643510508205172,
      "translation": "1번 핀을 표시하기 위해 작은 빨간색 테이프 조각을 붙입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:42.465116Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "Your Oyster PMOD is ready to be used !",
      "source_hash": 16578154289481514254,
      "context_hash": 10109305094376958654,
      "translation": "이제 OysterPMOD를 사용할 준비가 되었습니다!",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:42.465117Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:3",
      "source": "If you have multiple FPGA boards, with a bit of care, it is quite easy to have a single Oyster PMOD and connect it / disconnect it multiple times (without having to connect all wires one by one).",
      "source_hash": 9511161082556729167,
      "context_hash": 14351645327667154140,
      "translation": "여러 개의 FPGA 보드가 있는 경우, 약간의 주의를 기울이면 하나의 OysterPMOD로 여러 번 연결/분리하는 것이 (전선을 하나씩 모두 연결할 필요 없이) 꽤 쉽습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "FPGA": "FPGA"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:42.465117Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Step 5",
      "source_hash": 14472067218036973616,
      "context_hash": 7839009076123696221,
      "translation": "5단계",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:42.465117Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "![](Images/OysterPMOD_demo.gif)",
      "source_hash": 5306087054366172610,
      "context_hash": 2022758709420745561,
      "translation": "![](Images/OysterPMOD_demo.gif)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:10.058169Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "FemtoRV32 support libraries can redirect `printf()` to the led matrix, to the OLED screen or to the UART.",
      "source_hash": 6746934923239097924,
      "context_hash": 2644292198966395374,
      "translation": "FemtoRV32 지원 라이브러리는 `printf()`를 led 매트릭스, OLED 화면 또는 UART로 리디렉션할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:10.058169Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "It has also some basic drawing functions for the OLED screen.",
      "source_hash": 10040622506232881731,
      "context_hash": 5460846254889624591,
      "translation": "또한 OLED 화면을 위한 몇 가지 기본적인 그리기 함수도 갖추고 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:10.058169Z",
      "issues": []
    }
  ]
}